{"id":"ac868dc670f0e475","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form.md","title":"半无限带且不写空白的规范形式","display":"thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form — 半无限带且不写空白的规范形式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form","aliases":["73-thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form"],"display":"thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form — 半无限带且不写空白的规范形式","depends_on":["[[73-df-book-tm-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.1, Theorem 8.12, print pp. 352–355; PDF pp. 374–377","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form — 半无限带且不写空白的规范形式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0bc309d04895dc6e\" href=\"?note=0bc309d04895dc6e\" title=\"73-df-book-tm-semantics\">73-df-book-tm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.1, Theorem 8.12, print pp. 352–355; PDF pp. 374–377"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\)</span> 取第三版的双向带元组；限制表述为从每个输入初态可达的配置读头从不进入负位置，且所有转移均不写 b。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_\\Sigma\\;\\left[L=L_B(M)\\land\n\\left(\\forall((q,x),(p,y,d))\\in\\pi_4(M)\\;y\\ne\\pi_6(M)\\right)\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;\n\\left(((\\pi_5(M),T_{M,w}^B,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{BookConf}_M}(R_M^B)\n\\Longrightarrow\\pi_3(C)\\ge0\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_\\Sigma\\;\\left[L=L_B(M)\\land\n\\left(\\forall((q,x),(p,y,d))\\in\\pi_4(M)\\;y\\ne\\pi_6(M)\\right)\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;\n\\left(((\\pi_5(M),T_{M,w}^B,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{BookConf}_M}(R_M^B)\n\\Longrightarrow\\pi_3(C)\\ge0\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一种可选受限形式，不能再把它误写成第三版基本模型。先用新符号 B′ 代表已访问格上的空白，再以双轨折叠双向带；有限控制保存当前轨，左端标记避免越界。可先把输入字符改写成对应轨符号，所以仍接受原输入字母表上的同一语言。反向直接视为普通 TM。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-book-tm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0bc309d04895dc6e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-book-tm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_\\Sigma\\;\\left[L=L_B(M)\\land\n\\left(\\forall((q,x),(p,y,d))\\in\\pi_4(M)\\;y\\ne\\pi_6(M)\\right)\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{BookConf}_M\\;\n\\left(((\\pi_5(M),T_{M,w}^B,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{BookConf}_M}(R_M^B)\n\\Longrightarrow\\pi_3(C)\\ge0\\right)\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1831,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-semi-infinite-nonblank-normal-form|半无限带且不写空白的规范形式]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["0bc309d04895dc6e","11b19b6d211be8ab"]}